#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/frps-advanced.js:437
msgid ""
"When enabled, frps will only accept control connections encrypted with TLS. "
"Non-TLS clients are rejected. Default: off. Scenario: public networks or "
"untrusted LAN environments. Risk: legacy clients without TLS support will be "
"unable to connect. Requires TLS certificate and key to be configured."
msgstr ""
"开启后，frps 仅接受使用 TLS 的控制连接，并拒绝未启用 TLS 的客户端。默认关闭。"
"适合公网或不可信网络环境。风险：未启用 TLS 或不兼容的旧客户端将无法连接。如需"
"证书身份验证或双向 TLS，请另外配置证书、私钥和受信任 CA。"

